form bit
  case off
  case on

task flip
  take b, like bit
  like bit
  fork case, read b
    case off
      send back
        make on
    case on
      send back
        make off

rule flip-off-is-on
  show hold
    call is-equal
      call flip
        make off
      make on
  calm wrong

rule flip-on-is-off
  show hold
    call is-equal
      call flip
        make on
      make off
  calm
